WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:04.560
- I'm here at the Beijing Winter Olympics

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:07.540
and these ATM machines just caught my eye.

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:09.360
They are not just normal ATM machines

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:12.460
that allow you to
deposit or withdraw cash.

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:15.150
They also let international visitors

00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:17.530
and participants to the Games

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:20.054
to exchange their foreign bank bills

00:00:20.054 --> 00:00:22.304
into the that digital yuan.

00:00:23.518 --> 00:00:27.018
(gentle futuristic music)

00:00:37.863 --> 00:00:39.503
Let's just try it out.

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:42.293
I have near when me a $20 bill.

00:00:44.399 --> 00:00:47.316
(speaking Chinese)

00:00:54.970 --> 00:00:57.990
So now I'm going to insert this $20 bill.

00:00:59.354 --> 00:01:00.420
- [ATM] Please wait.

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:02.467
Please take away e-CNY.

00:01:03.507 --> 00:01:08.507
- [Jing] Now I have a card
with the equivalent amount

00:01:08.940 --> 00:01:12.810
of $20 of e-CNY with me on this card.

00:01:13.933 --> 00:01:16.180
(pensive music)

00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:19.710
- [Woman] You can go to
almost every point of sales

00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:21.410
inside the Olympics bubble.

00:01:21.410 --> 00:01:25.360
We have the dining halls and
then the merchandise stores.

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:27.770
You can use the e-CNY physical card

00:01:27.770 --> 00:01:29.493
to pay for all of these things.

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:33.310
- So I just found a coffee shop here.

00:01:33.310 --> 00:01:35.030
I just ordered an Americano.

00:01:35.030 --> 00:01:37.683
Okay, and I'm tapping the card.

00:01:42.824 --> 00:01:44.074
And we're done.

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:48.833
Now I have my first coffee,
paid with the e-CNY.

00:01:49.668 --> 00:01:52.335
(pensive music)

00:01:55.610 --> 00:01:59.280
So far, the digital yuan
has failed to resonate.

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:04.170
I've spoken to a number of
foreign Games participants.

00:02:04.170 --> 00:02:09.170
All of them either say they
do not intend to use the e-CNY

00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:11.730
or some of them even haven't heard of it.

00:02:13.601 --> 00:02:16.268
(pensive music)

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:23.040
The near-term goal for the e-CNY

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:25.200
is to popularize it within China,

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:28.120
but so far this has met some challenges.

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:31.050
First is that the e-CNY
is facing competition

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:33.970
from other entrenched
mobile payment platforms.

00:02:33.970 --> 00:02:35.990
Another reason is the privacy,

00:02:35.990 --> 00:02:39.500
because it is possible that
every transaction you make

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:43.140
can be seen and be visible to authorities.

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:44.850
But China is the way ahead

00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:47.370
in the development of the digital currency

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:50.930
compared to other
countries, including the US,

00:02:50.930 --> 00:02:53.403
which is considering
its own digital dollar.

